# 💰 SpendWise – Personal Budget Tracker

## Project Description
SpendWise is a personal budget tracking web application designed to help users manage their income, monitor expenses, organize spending categories and track savings.

The application uses Kenyan Shillings (KSh) as its currency.

## Live Website
https://spendwise-kenya-2026.netlify.app

## GitHub Repository
https://github.com/Abdull809/SpendWise

## Features
- Dashboard displaying income, expenses and remaining balance.
- Monthly budget tracking.
- Add and manage expenses.
- Spending categories.
- Recent transaction records.
- Savings goal tracking.
- Settings and demo data reset.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5 – Website structure.
- CSS3 – Styling and responsive design.
- JavaScript – Application functionality and interactivity.
- Git and GitHub – Version control and project hosting.
- Netlify – Website deployment and hosting.

